  "title": "Independent Bank Corp. Reports Third Quarter Net Income of $34.3 Million",
  "summary": "Independent Bank Corp. (Nasdaq Global Select Market: INDB), parent of Rockland Trust Company, today announced 2025 third quarter net income of $34.3 million, or $0.69 per diluted share, as compared to 2025 second quarter net income of $51.1 million, or $1.20 per diluted share. The decrease in net income was primarily driven by higher merger-related costs and the current period provision for credit losses associated with the Company’s recently completed acquisition of Enterprise Bancorp, Inc. (“E",
